### Real-World Implementation: Member Eligibility Caching

**Business Context**: Member eligibility verification is the most frequently accessed operation in healthcare APIs. Eligibility is checked before every service (pharmacy fills, doctor visits, hospital admissions). Texas Medicaid API received 8.5M daily eligibility checks, with 72% checking the same 400K active members repeatedly within 4-hour windows.

**Implementation Approach**:

```csharp
public class EligibilityService
{
    private readonly ICacheService _cache;
    private readonly IEligibilityRepository _repository;
    private readonly IEncryptionService _encryption;
    private const int EligibilityTTLHours = 4;

    public async Task<MemberEligibility> GetEligibilityAsync(
        string tenantId, string memberId, DateTime effectiveDate)
    {
        var cacheKey = $"{tenantId}:eligibility:{memberId}:{effectiveDate:yyyyMMdd}";

        // Check cache
        var encryptedData = await _cache.GetAsync<byte[]>(cacheKey);
        if (encryptedData != null)
        {
            // Decrypt PHI from cache (HIPAA requirement)
            var decrypted = await _encryption.DecryptAsync(encryptedData);
            return JsonSerializer.Deserialize<MemberEligibility>(decrypted);
        }

        // Cache miss - query eligibility database
        var eligibility = await _repository.GetEligibilityAsync(
            tenantId, memberId, effectiveDate);

        // Encrypt before caching (HIPAA requirement)
        var serialized = JsonSerializer.Serialize(eligibility);
        var encrypted = await _encryption.EncryptAsync(serialized);

        // Cache with 4-hour TTL (state contract requirement)
        await _cache.SetAsync(
            cacheKey,
            encrypted,
            TimeSpan.FromHours(EligibilityTTLHours));

        return eligibility;
    }

    // Invalidate cache when eligibility changes
    public async Task UpdateEligibilityAsync(MemberEligibility eligibility)
    {
        await _repository.UpdateAsync(eligibility);

        // Invalidate cached eligibility
        var cacheKey = $"{eligibility.TenantId}:eligibility:{eligibility.MemberId}:" +
                      $"{eligibility.EffectiveDate:yyyyMMdd}";
        await _cache.DeleteAsync(cacheKey);

        // Publish invalidation event for other service instances
        await _eventBus.PublishAsync(new EligibilityUpdatedEvent
        {
            TenantId = eligibility.TenantId,
            MemberId = eligibility.MemberId,
            EffectiveDate = eligibility.EffectiveDate
        });
    }
}
```

**Results Achieved** (Texas Medicaid API, February-April 2024):
- **Response Time**: Reduced from 1,200ms (P95) to 12ms (P95) - 99% improvement
- **Cache Hit Rate**: 94% of eligibility checks served from cache
- **Database Load**: Reduced from 8.5M daily queries to 510K - 94% reduction
- **Cost Savings**: Reduced database costs by $32,000/month (annual savings: $384,000)
- **Compliance**: Maintained <4 hour data freshness per state contract (TTL = 4 hours)

